      "1": "Weak related alternative, not the requested experience",
      "0": "Unsupported or contradicts the request"
    },
    "missingRelevanceMeans": 0,
    "limitations": "Small English-only fictional catalog; subjective single-assistant labels; no user satisfaction, retention, supplier quality, booking conversion or competitive superiority evidence. Catalog runtime and schedule are not semantic suitability labels."
